sentences.text:
18. Let the applicant- Mohd. Tariq be released on bail in Case Crime No. 35 of 2023, under Sections 304, 308, 323, 420, 120-B I.P.C. and Section 7 Criminal Law Amendment Act, registered at Police Station Hazratganj, District Lucknow, on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.

